cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NEMA IQ Analyzer"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "The NEMA IQ Analyzer authors"
abstract: >-
  Offline, single-file HTML program for the analysis of the NEMA NU 2 (2012/2018) PET image-quality test
  (IEC/NEMA body phantom): sphere contrast, background variability and lung residual from PET DICOM images,
  with protocol checks, optional scanner profiles with published reference values, and a printable report.
keywords:
  - PET
  - NEMA NU 2
  - image quality
  - quality assurance
  - DICOM
  - medical physics
